## 8. Software Engineering vs. Systems Engineering / 软件工程 vs. 系统工程

- Systems engineering is an interdisciplinary field focusing on designing and managing complex engineering projects.
- 系统工程是一门跨学科工程领域，侧重于如何设计和管理复杂的工程项目。
- Systems engineering deals with all aspects of computer-based system development, including hardware, software, people, database, and networks.
- 系统工程涉及基于计算机系统开发的各个方面，包括硬件、软件、人员、数据库和网络。
- Software engineering is a part of systems engineering.
- 软件工程是系统工程的一个组成部分。

